---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Hero from '../../components/Hero.astro';
import NewsletterSignup from '../../components/NewsletterSignup.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Kingston-North Kitsap Rotary Club" description="Learn about the Kingston-North Kitsap Rotary Club's role in the North Kitsap United project.">
  <Hero title="Kingston-North Kitsap Rotary Club" subtitle="A non-profit service club focused on community service" />

  <section class="py-12 sm:py-16">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <!-- Rotary Logo -->
      <div class="text-center mb-8">
        <img src="/images/logos/rotaryknk-logo-blue.png" alt="Kingston-North Kitsap Rotary Club logo" class="w-150 h-32 mx-auto object-contain" />
      </div>

      <div class="prose">
        <p>
          The Kingston-North Kitsap Rotary Club is a non-profit service club focused on community service and engagement 
          in the North Kitsap area (Kingston, Hansville, Eglon, Indianola, Suquamish and unincorporated areas of Poulsbo). 
          Over the years, the club has surveyed members of the Kingston and greater North Kitsap communities to identify 
          the most pressing needs and focused their efforts on filling those needs.
        </p>

        <h2>Community Contributions</h2>
        <p>
          Past initiatives include trail markers in the Heritage Park, lights at the Kingston High School football and 
          track & field, an improved library and community center (Village Green Community Center, Park & Picnic Pavilion), 
          and a way to better communicate on-going information (electronic reader board).
        </p>

        <h2>Addressing Community Needs</h2>
        <p>
          Over the past few years, it has come to their attention that there is a lack of necessary sports and recreation 
          facilities available for the youth in North Kitsap. A project to fulfil this need was officially announced at 
          their February 2023 fundraising auction and immediately gained significant community support. Soon afterwards, 
          they were made aware of the opportunity to work on a larger vision in collaboration with Raydient and YMCA that 
          has the potential to better fill these sports and recreation needs.
        </p>

        <h2>Role in the Sports Complex</h2>
        <p>
          Rotary’s role in this vision is focusing on the creation of a multi-generational, multi-use sports and recreation 
          complex that fulfils the community’s need and complements existing facilities in North Kitsap. The vision is for 
          this complex to consist of indoor and outdoor facilities that provide a wide range of sports and recreation 
          opportunities for all ages – as well as health and wellness amenities. The Kingston-North Kitsap Rotary Club plans 
          on leading the fundraising efforts, raising awareness, and facilitating partnerships for this sports and recreation 
          complex on behalf of the North Kitsap community.
        </p>

        <p class="mt-6">
          <a href="https://rotaryknk.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2">
            Visit the Kingston-North Kitsap Rotary Club website
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 6H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2v-4M14 4h6m0 0v6m0-6L10 14" />
            </svg>
          </a>
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-8 flex justify-center">
        <div class="w-full max-w-md rounded-lg overflow-hidden border border-gray-200">
          <div class="aspect-[9/16] bg-black">
            <iframe
              src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/f8o-QvTkN-E"
              title="If not Rotary, who?"
              allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture"
              allowfullscreen
              loading="lazy"
              class="w-full h-full"
            ></iframe>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Cross-links -->
      <div class="mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-gray-200">
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-nku-gray mb-4">Our Partners</h3>
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4">
          <a href="/planning-team/ymca-of-pierce-and-kitsap-counties" class="flex-1 p-4 rounded-lg border border-gray-200 hover:border-nku-green hover:shadow-md transition-all text-center">
            <span class="font-medium text-nku-gray">YMCA of Pierce and Kitsap Counties</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <NewsletterSignup />
</BaseLayout>
